        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/dddc48a7fadc3d15f0038b8b8ef2a781309b9d10/models/2026-delphi10000-ambystoma-mexicanum-turing-wavelength-s0.py#L172-L219> .
